   "Rows are MEASURED by running the real pipeline (run_detection) over the fusion dataset builder's procedurally crafted page pairs for a strict subset of axes; nothing is hand-authored. Regenerate deliberately (and re-verify the per-axis invariants) whenever detector behavior changes intentionally.",
